an typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Tactical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp/300px-Generic_Tactical.webp, /w/images/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp/300px-Generic_Tactical.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Liberated Spellcasting</b> is a toggleable passive feature that lets you cast a spell without using up a slot, after killing a creature.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you kill a creature, you can cast a Level 1 spell without expending a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Liberated_Spellcasting\"> Condition: Liberated Spellcasting </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Liberated_Spellcasting_(Condition)\" title=\"Liberated Spellcasting (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Liberated Spellcasting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Liberated_Spellcasting_(Condition)\" title=\"Liberated Spellcasting (Condition)\">Liberated Spellcasting</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>You can cast a level 1 spell without spending a spell slot.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Executioner_Sword\" title=\"Executioner Sword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Shortsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Executioner_Sword\" title=\"Executioner Sword\">Executioner Sword</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Level 1 spells can be upcasted without expending a higher level spell slot, even if the caster has no spell slots remaining for that level.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715000040\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1303/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14178/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3055/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/75